                <h1>Controllers and Actions</h1>
                <div class="lesson-meta"><span class="lesson-duration"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>35 min</span><span class="lesson-level intermediate">Intermediate</span></div>
